{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Flow step debugger P3: open a debug session on flow command lib.ctl.cmd. debug_start(lib, ctl, cmd, body, args) -> {status, session, cursor 0, hash, ...}. body = the root Case JSON to debug - an UNSAVED editor body is allowed; pass {} to debug the saved body. args = the flow's arguments (raw, no cast_params). The session lives in memory (globals.flowstep_debug) until debug_stop or the idle reaper (debug_reap timer, 30 min). Drive it with debug_step (into/over/out/run_to/continue/back/goto/edit/branch/pause), inspect with debug_state, set breakpoints with debug_set_breakpoints. Admin-only.","import":"use flowlang::command::Command;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse std::panic;","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"cmd","type":"String"},{"name":"body","type":"JSONObject"},{"name":"args","type":"JSONObject"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"nmmhrq1a16a46ef33ra4","readers":[],"time":1792784403802,"username":"system","writers":[]}